# Trivy ignore list — every entry needs a justification and a rotation
# condition. Remove entries as soon as the upstream fix ships.
#
# --- pack CLI: embedded docker/docker v28.5.2 --------------------------
# Applies to the switchyard-api AND roundhouse-worker images (both install
# pack 0.40.7; CVE IDs are image-agnostic, so these three entries cover both).
# pack 0.40.7 (latest release as of 2026-07-07) vendors docker/docker
# v28.5.2. No pack release has adopted a fixed docker version yet
# (CVE-2026-34040 is fixed in docker 29.3.1; the other two have no
# upstream fix released). Exposure is limited: pack is a CLI the API
# shells out to for buildpacks builds — it is not a network listener and
# the embedded docker client code paths are not reachable from untrusted
# input in our usage.
# ROTATE OUT: when a pack release built on docker >= 29.3.1 ships
# (watch https://github.com/buildpacks/pack/releases), bump PACK_VERSION
# in apps/switchyard-api/Dockerfile AND apps/roundhouse/Dockerfile, then
# delete these three lines.
CVE-2026-41567
CVE-2026-42306
CVE-2026-34040
